# sqlx hashes migration files byte-for-byte and records the checksum in
# _sqlx_migrations. Letting core.autocrlf rewrite line endings on checkout
# changes those bytes and makes the backend fail at startup with
# Migrate(VersionMismatch(N)) even though the SQL is unchanged.
# Pin migrations to LF so the checked-out bytes always match the stored blob.
backend/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
